<title>SPAIN: Spain's La Caixa Q1 net profit 21.0 bln ptas.</title>
<headline>Spain's La Caixa Q1 net profit 21.0 bln ptas.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Group results for first quarter 1997 (billion pesetas, unless stated).</p>
<p> Net attributable profit		 21.0   vs  16.7</p>
<p> Net profit				  23.2   vs  18.6</p>
<p> Pretax profit			     32.9   vs  25.5</p>
<p> Net interest income		     55.3   vs  54.2</p>
<p> Ordinary income			   79.3   vs  72.0</p>
<p> Operating income			  20.6   vs  16.8</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name: Caja de Ahorros y Pensiones de Barcelona - La Caixa.</p>
</text>
